# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### POST /products
- :warning: added the new required request property `data/else/newField`
- :warning: added the new required request property `data/then/newField`
-  added the new optional request property `data/contains/newField`
-  added the new optional request property `data/contentSchema/newField`
-  added the new optional request property `data/dependentSchemas[name]/newField`
-  added the new optional request property `data/patternProperties[^x-]/newField`
-  added the new optional request property `data/prefixItems[subschema #1]/newField`
-  added the new optional request property `data/unevaluatedProperties/newField`




## Info
-  a breaking change was detected but the version is still `1.0.0`




